      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "G = rt.GraphRT()\n\n@G.node()\ndef const1():\n    return 5\n\n@G.node()\ndef const2():\n    return 2\n\n@G.node(a=const1, b=const2):\ndef mult(a, b):\n    return a*n\n",
